nd twenty days."],"ref":"II Samuel 24:8","verse":8,"words":[{"text":"So when they had gone","strong":"H7751"},{"text":" through all the land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", they came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Jerusalem","strong":"H3389"},{"text":" at the end","strong":"H7097"},{"text":" of nine","strong":"H8672"},{"text":" months","strong":"H2320"},{"text":" and twenty","strong":"H6242"},{"text":" days","strong":"H3117"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8701,"title":"II Samuel 24:9","segments":["And Joab gave up the sum of the number of the people unto the king: and there were in Israel eight hundred thousand valiant men that drew the sword; and the men of Judah [were] five hundred thousand men."],"ref":"II Samuel 24:9","verse":9,"words":[{"text":"And Joab","strong":"H3097"},{"text":" gave up","strong":"H5414"},{"text":" the sum","strong":"H4557"},{"text":" of the number","strong":"H4662"},{"text":" of the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":" unto the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":": and there were in Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":" eight","strong":"H8083"},{"text":" hundred","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":" valiant","strong":"H2428"},{"text":" men","strong":"H376"},{"text":"","strong":"H381"},{"text":" that drew","strong":"H8025"},{"text":" the sword","strong":"H2719"},{"text":"; and the men","strong":"H376"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":" [were] five","strong":"H2568"},{"text":" hundred","strong":"H3967"},{"text":" thousand","strong":"H505"},{"text":" men","strong":"H376"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8702,"title":"II Samuel 24:10","segments":["¶And David's heart smote him after that he had numbered the people. And David said unto the LORD, I have sinned greatly in that I have done: and now, I beseech thee, O LORD, take away the iniquity of thy servant; for I have done very foolishly."],"ref":"II Samuel 24:10","verse":10,"words":[{"text":"¶And David's","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" heart","strong":"H3820"},{"text":" smote","strong":"H5221"},{"text":" him after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" that he had numbered","strong":"H5608"},{"text":" the people","strong":"H5971"},{"text":". And David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", I have sinned","strong":"H2398"},{"text":" greatly","strong":"H3966"},{"text":" in that I have done","strong":"H6213"},{"text":": and now, I beseech thee, O LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", take away","strong":"H5674"},{"text":" the iniquity","strong":"H5771"},{"text":" of thy servant","strong":"H5650"},{"text":"; for I have done very","strong":"H3966"},{"text":" foolishly","strong":"H5528"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8703,"title":"II Samuel 24:11","segments":["For when David was up in the morning, the word of the LORD came unto the prophet Gad, David's seer, saying,"],"ref":"II Samuel 24:11","verse":11,"words":[{"text":"For when David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" was up","strong":"H6965"},{"text":" in the morning","strong":"H1242"},{"text":", the word","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" came unto the prophet","strong":"H5030"},{"text":" Gad","strong":"H1410"},{"text":", David's","strong":"H1732"},{"text":" seer","strong":"H2374"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":","}]},{"id":8704,"title":"II Samuel 24:12","segments":["Go and say unto David, Thus saith the LORD, I offer thee three [things]; choose thee one of them, that I may [do it] unto thee."],"ref":"II Samuel 24:12","verse":12,"words":[{"text":"Go","strong":"H1980"},{"text":" and say","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":", Thus saith","strong":"H1696"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":", I offer","strong":"H5190"},{"text":" thee three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" [things]; choose","strong":"H977"},{"text":" thee one","strong":"H259"},{"text":" of them, that I may [do it] unto thee","strong":"H6213"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":8705,"title":"II Samuel 24:13","segments":["So Gad